ori-says-cwc/articleshow/134576710.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T05:45:04+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134576709,imgsize-127536.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[INDIA bloc to meet today to finalise plan for anti-SIR agitation]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-bloc-to-meet-today-to-finalise-plan-for-anti-sir-agitation/articleshow/134576666.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134576666.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The INDIA bloc's opposition members are set to meet to formulate a plan of action against the Election Commission, centering on the resignation of Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar. Notable leaders from Congress and TMC will attend, while DMK and AAP will be absent. This meeting follows a recent protest by Left party members at the EC headquarters demanding Kumar's resignation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-bloc-to-meet-today-to-finalise-plan-for-anti-sir-agitation/articleshow/134576666.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-bloc-to-meet-today-to-finalise-plan-for-anti-sir-agitation/articleshow/134576666.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T05:40:04+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134576694,imgsize-166204.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Supreme Court to hear plea for CEC’s suspension, voiding SIR next week]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/supreme-court-to-hear-plea-for-cecs-suspension-voiding-sir-next-week/articleshow/134576542.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134576542.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indi